    <statement><p>Find the derivative of</p>
<p><m>y = \root 9 \of{x}</m>.</p>
<p><m>{dy\over dx} =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1}{9}x^{\frac{1}{9}-1}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>y = \root 9 \of{x} = x^{1/9}</m>, we have

<me>{dy\over dx} = \frac{1}{9} x^{(1/9) - 1} = 
    \frac{1}{9} x^{-8/9}.</me>


</solution>
